  "memo": "This tree has a graceful, weeping habit with slender branches that give it a delicate appearance. Its narrow, evergreen leaves are dark green and slightly leathery, providing a lush canopy year-round. Small, fragrant white flowers bloom in clusters, adding a subtle but pleasant aroma to the surroundings. The tree is drought-tolerant and thrives in a variety of soil types, making it a resilient choice for urban landscapes. Its moderate growth rate and manageable size make it suitable for both small gardens and larger public spaces.",
