  "schoolyard_use_notes": "This tree has long, slender leaves that can be used to teach about leaf structure and function. Its small, white flowers bloom in clusters, providing an opportunity to discuss pollination and flower anatomy. The tree's resilience to drought conditions makes it a suitable example for lessons on plant adaptation and survival in arid environments. The leaves also release a pleasant aroma when crushed, adding a sensory element to educational activities.",
